    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-est5">
        <head xml:id="gom-est5-Hd1e98">Caput 5</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-est5-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-est5-Hd1e102">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-est5-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-est5-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/est5_2@13-14">Virgam auream.</quote>
            Regiminis potentiam vel passionis crucem, per quam acquisivit <pb ed="#P" n="0744C"/> potestatem, de qua dicitur: <quote xml:id="gom-est5-Qd1e111" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt28_18@8-17">Data est mihi omnis potestas in coelo et in terra .</quote> Et alibi: <quote xml:id="gom-est5-Qd1e114" source="http://scta.info/resource/phil2_9@1-13">Propter quod exaltavit illum, et dedit illi nomen quod est super omne nomen .</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-est5-Dd1e119">
          <head xml:id="gom-est5-Hd1e121">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-est5-d1e123">
            <quote xml:id="gom-est5-Qd1e125" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/est5_8@1-5">Si inveni in conspectu.</quote>
            Dilatio petendi non deputatur segnitiei, sed patientiae. Non enim in praesenti sed in futuro bonis et malis retribuetur merces: cras enim pro futuro ponitur, unde: <quote xml:id="gom-est5-Qd1e128" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc12_11@12-14">Nolite solliciti esse de crastino;</quote> et Jacob in Genesi ait: <quote xml:id="gom-est5-Qd1e131" source="http://scta.info/resource/gen30_33@2-5">Apparebit mihi cras justitia mea .<!-- check: Migne cites mt6; text matches gen30_33 --></quote> Et de agno dicitur: <quote xml:id="gom-est5-Qd1e135" source="http://scta.info/resource/ex12_10@2-7">Non remanebit ex eo quidquam usque mane .<!-- check: Migne cites gen30; text matches ex12_10 --></quote> Cum judicium venerit, revelabitur quali veste quisquam ad convivium intraverit.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
